+ 
++/* Give the NSS firmware a virtual device for this interface.
++ *
++ * The firmware addresses a transmitted frame to a virtual device and names
++ * the same device on a frame it hands up, so the network device is what the
++ * registration binds the number to. Frames across it are ethernet, which is
++ * what the hardware encapsulation and decapsulation this driver has already
